## 2. Grammar – Ngữ pháp

### 2.1 There is / There are

Dùng để nói về sự **tồn tại** của vật/người tại một nơi.

```
There is + a/an + danh từ số ít     (There's)
There are + danh từ số nhiều
```

| Khẳng định | Phủ định | Câu hỏi |
|---|---|---|
| There **is** a bank near here. | There **isn't** a bank near here. | **Is there** a bank near here? |
| There **are** two parks in this area. | There **aren't** any parks here. | **Are there** any parks here? |

**Trả lời ngắn:**
- Is there a pharmacy nearby? → **Yes, there is.** / **No, there isn't.**
- Are there any restaurants here? → **Yes, there are.** / **No, there aren't.**

---

### 2.2 Prepositions of Place – Giới từ chỉ vị trí

| Giới từ | Ý nghĩa | Ví dụ |
|---|---|---|
| **next to** | bên cạnh | The bank is **next to** the post office. |
| **between** | giữa | The cafe is **between** the bank and the park. |
| **across from / opposite** | đối diện | The museum is **across from** the library. |
| **near / close to** | gần | There's a bus stop **near** my house. |
| **in front of** | phía trước | The taxi is **in front of** the hotel. |
| **behind** | phía sau | The parking lot is **behind** the mall. |
| **on the corner of** | ở góc | The shop is **on the corner of** Main Street. |

---

### 2.3 Cấu trúc hỏi đường

```
Excuse me, how do I get to [place]?
Excuse me, where is the nearest [place]?
Is there a [place] near here?
Could you tell me the way to [place]?
```

**Cấu trúc chỉ đường:**

```
Go straight, then turn left/right at [landmark].
It's on your left/right.
It's next to / opposite / between [landmark].
It's about [time/distance] from here.
```

