## 3. Key Conversations – Hội thoại giao tiếp

![Hỏi đường — kỹ năng sống còn khi du lịch](https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524661135-423995f22d0b?w=700&q=80)

### Conversation A: Hỏi đường đến nhà hàng

> **A:** Excuse me, how do I get to Sun Restaurant?
> **B:** Sure! Go straight on this street, then turn left at the traffic light.
> **A:** Turn left at the traffic light, OK.
> **B:** Then it's on your right, next to the bookstore.
> **A:** Is it far from here?
> **B:** No, it's about five minutes on foot.
> **A:** Great, thank you so much!

---

### Conversation B: Tìm địa điểm gần đó

> **A:** Excuse me, is there a pharmacy near here?
> **B:** Yes, there is. There's one across from the supermarket.
> **A:** And how do I get to the supermarket from here?
> **B:** Go straight, then turn right at the corner. It's between the bank and the park.
> **A:** Perfect. Thanks for your help!

---

### Conversation C: Mô tả khu vực sinh sống

> **A:** What's your neighborhood like?
> **B:** It's really convenient. There are two supermarkets and a hospital nearby.
> **A:** Is there a park close to your house?
> **B:** Yes! There's a beautiful park behind my apartment building.
> **A:** That sounds great. Are there any good cafes around?
> **B:** Definitely. There's a really nice one on the corner of my street.

